{"created": "2026-10-17T04:50:39.560366+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-17T04:50:40.053980+00:00", "id": 23430498, "conceptrecid": "23430497", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23430498", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23430497", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23430498", "metadata": {"title": "Finite-type invariants on free-exterior string links: low-degree restrictions and an order-seven example", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23430498", "publication_date": "2026-10-13", "description": "<p>This unrefereed, extensively AI-assisted application note studies ordinary unframed smooth ordered string links with fixed boundary and upward orientation; upward does not impose height monotonicity. Invariants are rational and freeness concerns the actual three-dimensional exterior group, abstractly the free group of rank k, without a primitive-meridian condition.</p><p>The entire all-length repeated-index Milnor algebra intersected with the two-strand order-at-most-two space is recalled as the span of 1, linking, and linking squared, a filtered Habegger\u2013Masbaum corollary. Applications of Meilhan's complete classification and prior free tangles show that a component Conway coefficient is outside the Milnor-plus-vanishing span at (k,n)=(2,2), and that the vanishing kernel is zero for all k\u22652 and 0\u2264n\u22642. Exact marked genus-two reversal, combined with the prior Duzhin\u2013Karev ordinary detector, gives an existential nonzero kernel invariant of exact ordinary order seven on two strands, hence nonzero kernels for every n\u22657.</p><p>The wheel is credited to Bar-Natan following Duzhin\u2013Karev's journal proof. Known tangle examples, rational 3/2 geometry, classical genus-two machinery, and Hatcher's relative-ball theorem are credited in the manuscript. Historical priority of the combined applications is undetermined; no firstness or new detector is claimed. Orders three through six, least positive kernel order, and higher-order classification are unaddressed by this work. Morimoto (1995) and Li (2009) remain unread priority leads and are not mathematical dependencies.</p><p>AI was used extensively in solving, verification, source investigation, and writing. Internal AI audits are not conventional human peer review or formal certification. New finite arithmetic programs in the supporting kit provide supplementary stage evidence, not full theorem proof; the unchanged original edition is theoretical and delivered no executable replay. No numeric value of the existential invariant on a named nonsingular link is supplied.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kriebel, Alec", "affiliation": "Independent researcher", "orcid": "0009-0001-9320-500X"}], "keywords": ["string links", "finite-type invariants", "free tangles", "Milnor invariants", "genus-two hyperelliptic symmetry"], "version": "1.0", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23430497"}}]}, "notes": "Unrefereed application note. Extensive AI assistance and AI audits; no conventional human peer review or formal certification. Historical priority of the combined applications is undetermined. The accompanying kit records the review history through 13 October 2026 and the current preparation state. No publication action has been performed by this preparation task."}, "title": "Finite-type invariants on free-exterior string links: low-degree restrictions and an order-seven example", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23430498", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23430498?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23430498", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23430498", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23430498", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430497", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23430497", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23430497", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23430497", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498:free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498:free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498:free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498:free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498:free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23430498:free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23430498/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-17T04:50:40.053980+00:00", "recid": "23430498", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "113bec5e-19eb-4d67-a48b-52d74bb4a201", "key": "free-exterior-string-links-v1.0-source-audit-kit.zip", "size": 1899507, "checksum": "md5:c78fd7ad99261f46565de9e37826dd6e", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/files/free-exterior-string-links-v1.0-source-audit-kit.zip/content"}}, {"id": "fe6a20ea-45c7-48bc-ae80-f0cec0210389", "key": "free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf", "size": 132958, "checksum": "md5:c0f7a0828b970f7fea33d6d3b983c0f7", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23430498/files/free-exterior-string-links-v1.0.pdf/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "1789874"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 22, "unique_downloads": 22, "views": 32, "unique_views": 30, "version_downloads": 22, "version_unique_downloads": 22, "version_unique_views": 30, "version_views": 32}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}